w: 1.~Come, ye thank- ful peo- ple, come, Raise the song of har- vest\-- home!
w: 2.~We our- selves are God’s own field, Fruit un- to His praise to yield;
w: 3.~For the Lord our God shall come, And shall take His har- vest home;
w: 4.~Then, thou Church tri- um- phant, come, Bring the song of har- vest\-- home;
w: 5.~Grant us grace to see Thee, Lord, Mir- rored in Thy ho- ly Word; 
